# =======================================================
# Nyaya Sahayak - Environment Configuration
# =======================================================

# Google Gemini API Key
# Get a key from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/
# MANDATORY FOR LIVE EVALUATION & VERCEL DEPLOYMENT:
# In local dev: Copy this to .env.local and populate GEMINI_API_KEY.
# On Vercel: Add GEMINI_API_KEY in Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
GEMINI_API_KEY="your-gemini-api-key-here"

# Model selection (recommended current stable: gemini-3.6-flash or gemini-2.5-flash)
GEMINI_MODEL="gemini-3.6-flash"

# Optional Rate Limiting threshold (requests per minute per IP, default: 20)
RATE_LIMIT_MAX="20"
